=head1 DESCRIPTION

Container for the parameters required to enable EBS-based storage for
an OpenSearch Service domain.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 EBSEnabled => Bool

Indicates whether EBS volumes are attached to data nodes in an
OpenSearch Service domain.


=head2 Iops => Int

Specifies the baseline input/output (I/O) performance of EBS volumes
attached to data nodes. Applicable only for the C<gp3> and provisioned
IOPS EBS volume types.


=head2 Throughput => Int

Specifies the throughput (in MiB/s) of the EBS volumes attached to data
nodes. Applicable only for the C<gp3> volume type.


=head2 VolumeSize => Int

Specifies the size (in GiB) of EBS volumes attached to data nodes.


=head2 VolumeType => Str

Specifies the type of EBS volumes attached to data nodes.



